    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "# Proby \u2014 deployment overview\nSelect a **site (`$site`)**; **`$iface`** filters the interface graphs. Per-ICMP-target rows show an RTT distribution heatmap, latency percentiles, packet-loss/availability and an MTR-style traceroute. Red vertical markers = **interface flaps**. Env / ARP / routing panels need the pushgateway `include_environment: true`."
